# The source of mana an ability produces is that ability's source (CR 106.3): tapping Barracks of the Thousand with Mana Flare
# out adds the Barracks' {W} and, by Mana Flare's triggered mana ability, a {W} whose source is Mana Flare. On turn 7 Bot1
# casts Healer's Hawk with the plain {W} (`Spend: W`), which is Mana Flare's: no Gnome Soldier. The second Hawk is cast with
# the Barracks' {W}: a Gnome Soldier. (Turn 3 taps the Smithy among the five; turn 5 casts Mana Flare with the Barracks', a
# Plains' and a Mountain's mana, an enchantment spell that makes none.)

